  "plain": "A documentary filmmaker named James Fox, on Jesse Michels's podcast in 2025, passes on what a witness told him about January 1996 in the Brazilian town of Varginha. According to that account, local firefighters caught a strange screaming creature with a net, the way they would catch a wild animal. If true, it would mean a living non-human being was captured by ordinary town workers."
